{
  "summary": "This experiment tested changing the fusion method from concat to weighted in a multimodal setup using scvi_n200 and ViT-L encoders with transformer aggregation, building on config_008. Validation accuracy improved slightly to 0.725 (from 0.7207) and F1 increased to 0.6847 (from 0.6815), suggesting weighted fusion may contribute to performance gains. Uncertainty remains about the relative impact of fusion strategy versus other uncontrolled factors, despite the isolated design comparison."
}

